<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-023" chapter-id="c-chenshu-023-shen-wang-lu-appraisal" source-id="s-chenshu-023-shen-wang-lu-appraisal-ws1514496">
  <p id="c-chenshu-023-shen-wang-lu-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：夫衣冠雅道，廊廟嘉猷，諒以操履敦脩，局宇詳正。經曰「容止可觀」，詩言「其儀罔忒」，彼三子者，其有斯風焉。</p>
